  "description": "Seung-Jeong inherits a shamanic power that only activates through intense pleasure shared with someone on the same wavelength. After a chance encounter at a casino ties him to Ga-Yoon, the two reunite under dangerous circumstances when Ga-Yoon’s adoptive father dies in a suspicious accident. Bound by desire and a dangerous power, they grow closer as they search for the truth. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes 18 extra chapters.*",
